[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-japan-study-support-scholarship-2026-application-guideline-136":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},136,"japan-study-support-scholarship-2026-application-guideline-136","Japan Study Support Scholarship 2026 | Application Guideline","\u003Cp>Applications are now being accepted from all qualified and interested international students for the 2026 Japan Study Support Scholarship.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Japan Study Support Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: JPSS\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-asia\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-Asia\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> ||  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fphd-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">PhD Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>300,000 yen\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: May 31, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Japan Study Support Scholarship Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Japan Study Support Scholarships is welcoming international students from all over the world except Japanese citizens who wish to start their higher \u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fjapan-study-support-scholarship\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>education\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa> institution in Japan.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Most of the scholarships are intended for international students studying at universities and colleges in Japan. As long as you adhere to the academic, age, financial requirements, getting a scholarship in Japan can be as simple as breathing.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Recipients of the scholarship are required to cooperate with JPSS activities (e.g., speaking at events, advising prospective international students, or being featured on SNS).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Japan Study Support Scholarship Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Japan Study Support Scholarship for Foreign Students offers:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>300,000 yen to four successful applicants after enrollment at the designated university in Japan.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>2026 Japan Study Support Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the undergraduate and postgraduate 2026 Japan Study Support Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Has been accepted to enroll in a Japanese university undergraduate or graduate degree program starting September–November 2025 or in April–May 2026, and enrollment has been confirmed. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Has a registered MY PAGE with JAPAN STUDY SUPPORT (hereinafter JPSS), \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Has received a message from aforesaid university via the “JPSS Scout function” prior to acceptance.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Is able to interview in either Japanese or English.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Has a Japanese bank account (in the applicant’s name) in to which scholarship money can be paid. Internet banks will not be accepted.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Is not a Japanese citizen.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>2026 Japan Study Support Scholarship Required Documents\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the 2026 Japan Study Support Scholarship, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Application form (basic information)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Short essay (Up to 350 English words or 800 Japanese characters on your ‘Motivation to Study in Japan &amp; Future Goals’. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Self Introduction Video (no more than 30 seconds in length)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>If any of the application documents or materials are found to contain false information, the application will be rejected and all and any scholarship already paid out must be paid back.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>If a successful candidate does not complete, dropsout or is expelled from their higher education course all and any scholarship money must be paid back.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>All scholarship recipients are required to submit periodic reports throughout their scholarship period (a few times per year).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.jpss.jp\u002Fen\u002Fmy\u002Fscholarship\u002Fapplication\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.jpss.jp\u002Fen\u002Fmy\u002Fscholarship\u002Fapplication\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-13 16:25:52",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fjapan-study-support-scholarship-2026-application-guideline\u002F69dd0b001256b1.59076212_screenshot 2026-04-13 162217.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fjapan-study-support-scholarship-2026-application-guideline\u002F69dd0b001256b1.59076212_screenshot%202026-04-13%20162217.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,48,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-oppo